{"repo": {"name": {"en-US": "Forkray"}, "description": {"en-US": "Forkray, a fork of v2rayNG, compiled from source on GitHub Actions. Every release publishes a build manifest with the exact sources, toolchain and checksums, so it can be rebuilt and compared. Source: https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/icon.png", "sha256": "9c27dbdfc17b129b97e31fc4efebb64b01b7a28c12bb8deab06462afb2a01b4b", "size": 786}}, "address": "https://acidefluorhydrique.github.io/v2rayNG/repo", "timestamp": 1790329552000, "categories": {"Internet": {"name": {"en-US": "Internet"}}}}, "packages": {"io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng": {"metadata": {"added": 1790329551000, "categories": ["Internet"], "changelog": "https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG/releases", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG/issues", "lastUpdated": 1790329552000, "license": "GPL-3.0-only", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG", "authorName": "AcideFluorhydrique (fork of v2rayNG by 2dust)", "name": {"en-US": "Forkray"}, "summary": {"en-US": "A V2Ray client for Android, forked from v2rayNG and built from source"}, "description": {"en-US": "<p>Forkray is a fork of <a href=\"https://github.com/2dust/v2rayNG\">v2rayNG</a>, the V2Ray client for Android, supporting <a href=\"https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core\">Xray core</a>. It follows every upstream v2rayNG release and keeps its features and settings.</p>\n\n<h3>How it differs from v2rayNG</h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Built entirely from source on public CI, including the Xray core, which upstream downloads as a prebuilt library. Every release publishes the exact sources, toolchain and checksums used, so it can be rebuilt and compared byte for byte.</li>\n<li>Its own application ID, so it installs alongside v2rayNG rather than replacing it.</li>\n<li>No in-app update check (your F-Droid client handles updates) and no promotion link.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Geoip and Geosite</h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li>geoip.dat and geosite.dat are in <code>Android/data/io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng/files/assets</code> (the path may differ on some devices).</li>\n<li>The download feature fetches the enhanced version from <a href=\"https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat\">Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat</a>; it needs a working proxy.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Source code and issues: <a href=\"https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG\">github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG</a>. Documentation for the shared features: the <a href=\"https://github.com/2dust/v2rayNG/wiki\">v2rayNG wiki</a>.</p>\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng/en-US/icon_6z4MS1fuvJIzlohfY_TaMDs7gYwsJz-3fNfrokpTG9k=.png", "sha256": "eb3e0c4b57eebc923396885f63f4da303b3b818c2c273fb77cd7eba24a531bd9", "size": 8921}}, "preferredSigner": "561d282e03be3557d09073fc317fcc2f4d3231fa26da662e290222f4b34f78d9"}, "versions": {"67286a6e50650ac3420fda62d4470c5858ab65c42bf34b42d2b63ef3b491fa2f": {"added": 1790329552000, "file": {"name": "/v2rayNG_2.3.9-fdroid_x86.apk", "sha256": "67286a6e50650ac3420fda62d4470c5858ab65c42bf34b42d2b63ef3b491fa2f", "size": 34391550}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["x86"], "versionName": "2.3.9", "versionCode": 5074904, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 24, "targetSdkVersion": 37}, "signer": {"sha256": ["561d282e03be3557d09073fc317fcc2f4d3231fa26da662e290222f4b34f78d9"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES"}, {"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_LOCAL_NETWORK"}, {"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.CAMERA"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED"}, {"name": "android.permission.WAKE_LOCK"}, {"name": "io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}}, "7a12fb7a2088e732d66029801ba63cf30cf1ed22601bc968eb89e36bb0159113": {"added": 1790329552000, "file": {"name": "/v2rayNG_2.3.9-fdroid_x86_64.apk", "sha256": "7a12fb7a2088e732d66029801ba63cf30cf1ed22601bc968eb89e36bb0159113", "size": 33891279}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["x86_64"], "versionName": "2.3.9", "versionCode": 5074903, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 24, "targetSdkVersion": 37}, "signer": {"sha256": ["561d282e03be3557d09073fc317fcc2f4d3231fa26da662e290222f4b34f78d9"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES"}, {"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_LOCAL_NETWORK"}, {"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.CAMERA"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED"}, {"name": "android.permission.WAKE_LOCK"}, {"name": "io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}}, "00f420f2f1ecf0c563753108329708208d21046011eec14f677c861300a02c02": {"added": 1790329551000, "file": {"name": "/v2rayNG_2.3.9-fdroid_armeabi-v7a.apk", "sha256": "00f420f2f1ecf0c563753108329708208d21046011eec14f677c861300a02c02", "size": 33314522}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["armeabi-v7a"], "versionName": "2.3.9", "versionCode": 5074902, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 24, "targetSdkVersion": 37}, "signer": {"sha256": ["561d282e03be3557d09073fc317fcc2f4d3231fa26da662e290222f4b34f78d9"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES"}, {"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_LOCAL_NETWORK"}, {"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.CAMER